.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-key\-import \- Import keys into the key store
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq key import\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIKEY_FILE\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Import keys into the key store.
.PP

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
 \fIKEY_FILE\fR
Read from KEY_FILE or stdin if omitted
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Import the keys into the key store.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq key import alice\-secret.pgp
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-key\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
